        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>宝宝米粉添加指南</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#f7a536;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",Arial,sans-serif;color:#343434}\nbody{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start}\n.page{\n  position:relative;\n  width:540px;\n  min-width:540px;\n  height:720px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  padding:13px 15px 12px;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffad3e 0%,#f79c2e 100%);\n}\n.sheet{\n  position:relative;\n  width:100%;\n  height:100%;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  border-radius:15px;\n  padding:7px 8px 8px;\n  background:#fffbd0;\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.45);\n}\n.header{\n  position:relative;\n  height:60px;\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:center;\n  align-items:flex-start;\n}\n.deco{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:-5px;\n  width:52px;\n  height:52px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  opacity:.76;\n}\n.deco.d1{left:38px;background:#e6a5af}\n.deco.d2{left:145px;background:#b9d6d7}\n.deco.d3{left:211px;background:#eab6bd}\n.deco.d4{left:276px;background:#b9d6a9}\n.deco.d5{left:349px;background:#abc7e5}\n.deco.d6{right:24px;background:#ffa63e}\n.main-title{\n  position:relative;\n  z-index:2;\n  margin:0;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  font-size:37px;\n  line-height:49px;\n  font-weight:900;\n  letter-spacing:1px;\n  color:#ffad40;\n  -webkit-text-stroke:2px #5c3b1f;\n  text-shadow:\n    2px 2px 0 #fff5bb,\n    -2px 2px 0 #fff5bb,\n    2px -2px 0 #fff5bb,\n    -2px -2px 0 #fff5bb,\n    3px 4px 0 rgba(106,71,34,.25);\n}\n.layout{\n  height:620px;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows:300px 310px;\n  gap:8px 9px;\n}\n.section{\n  position:relative;\n  min-width:0;\n}\n.section-heading{\n  position:relative;\n  height:39px;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  color:#f5a42d;\n  font-weight:900;\n  text-shadow:\n    1px 1px 0 #fff,\n    -1px 1px 0 #fff,\n    1px -1px 0 #fff,\n    -1px -1px 0 #fff,\n    2px 2px 0 #855733;\n}\n.heading-number{\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n  width:35px;\n  height:35px;\n  margin-right:5px;\n  border:3px solid #fff;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  color:#fff;\n  font-size:24px;\n  line-height:1;\n  font-style:italic;\n  text-shadow:none;\n  box-shadow:0 1px 1px #bb7d37;\n}\n.s1 .heading-number{background:#ef6676}\n.s2 .heading-number{background:#7965bc}\n.s3 .heading-number{background:#efb418}\n.s4 .heading-number{background:#ef8e37}\n.section-heading h2{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:20px;\n  line-height:1;\n  letter-spacing:-1px;\n}\n.panel{\n  border:3px solid #f29d31;\n  border-radius:15px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  background:#fffdf1;\n}\n.s1 .panel,.s2 .panel{height:261px}\n.s3 .panel,.s4 .panel{height:271px}\n\n.intro{\n  height:39px;\n  padding:6px 9px 3px;\n  font-size:8px;\n  line-height:12px;\n  font-weight:600;\n  background:#fffef3;\n}\n.stage{\n  position:relative;\n  height:72px;\n  margin:0 7px;\n  padding:5px 46px 3px 7px;\n  border-top:1px dashed #efaa5a;\n}\n.stage-title{\n  display:inline-block;\n  margin-bottom:2px;\n  padding:1px 8px 1px 4px;\n  color:#fff;\n  font-size:9px;\n  line-height:12px;\n  font-weight:800;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff9c31,#ffd55a);\n  border-radius:7px;\n}\n.stage p{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:7.7px;\n  line-height:11px;\n  font-weight:600;\n}\n.stage-icon{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:-1px;\n  top:6px;\n  width:43px;\n  height:43px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#82c8ae,#2d9e83);\n  border:2px solid #e8f8da;\n  color:#fff;\n  text-align:center;\n  font-size:7px;\n  line-height:9px;\n  padding-top:9px;\n  transform:rotate(-7deg);\n}\n.stage-icon b{display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:12px}\n.placeholder .caption{\n  position:absolute;\n  width:1px;\n  height:1px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  clip:rect(0 0 0 0);\n}\n\n.benefit-list{\n  height:100%;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-rows:repeat(5,1fr);\n}\n.benefit{\n  position:relative;\n  padding:7px 63px 4px 10px;\n  border-bottom:5px solid #edf3e7;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff 0 63%,#eef7e9 63%);\n}\n.benefit:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.benefit h3{\n  margin:0 0 3px;\n  font-size:9px;\n  font-weight:800;\n}\n.benefit p{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:7.5px;\n  line-height:11px;\n}\n.benefit-art{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:4px;\n  right:4px;\n  width:54px;\n  height:38px;\n}\n.bowl{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:8px;\n  bottom:4px;\n  width:29px;\n  height:13px;\n  border:2px solid #4f9db0;\n  border-radius:4px 4px 15px 15px;\n  background:#fff7bc;\n}\n.bowl:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-2px;\n  top:-5px;\n  width:29px;\n  height:7px;\n  border:2px solid #4f9db0;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n.spoon{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:32px;\n  top:5px;\n  width:20px;\n  height:3px;\n  border-radius:4px;\n  background:#e37c50;\n  transform:rotate(-35deg);\n}\n.spoon:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-5px;\n  top:-2px;\n  width:8px;\n  height:7px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#e37c50;\n}\n.nutrient{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:1px;\n  top:2px;\n  width:16px;\n  height:16px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  color:#fff;\n  font-size:7px;\n  line-height:16px;\n  text-align:center;\n  font-weight:bold;\n}\n.nutrient.fe{background:#bd4f9f}\n.nutrient.vd{top:0;right:0;background:#e0ad19}\n.baby-face{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:7px;\n  top:2px;\n  width:32px;\n  height:32px;\n  border:2px solid #c5846d;\n  border-radius:48% 52% 45% 55%;\n  background:#ffe0c9;\n}\n.baby-face:before,.baby-face:after{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  top:12px;\n  width:3px;height:4px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#333;\n}\n.baby-face:before{left:8px}.baby-face:after{right:8px}\n.brain{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:6px;\n  top:4px;\n  width:31px;\n  height:27px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#ef83aa;\n  border:2px solid #d06888;\n}\n.tooth{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:12px;\n  top:2px;\n  width:25px;\n  height:30px;\n  border:2px solid #86a89f;\n  border-radius:9px 9px 13px 13px;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n\n.pick-list{\n  height:100%;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-rows:repeat(6,1fr);\n}\n.pick{\n  position:relative;\n  min-height:0;\n  padding:5px 49px 3px 8px;\n  border-bottom:3px solid #fff;\n  background:#cbeff5;\n}\n.pick:nth-child(even){background:#d9f1f6}\n.pick:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.pick h3{\n  margin:0 0 2px;\n  font-size:8px;\n  line-height:9px;\n}\n.pick p{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:7.3px;\n  line-height:9.5px;\n}\n.pick-art{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:2px;\n  top:2px;\n  width:43px;\n  height:37px;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  background:#f7f4d9;\n}\n.package{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:8px;top:2px;\n  width:25px;height:31px;\n  border:2px solid #487986;\n  background:#f1cf39;\n  transform:rotate(-3deg);\n}\n.package:after{\n  content:\"S\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:6px;top:7px;\n  width:10px;height:13px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  color:#2580c7;\n  background:#fff;\n  text-align:center;\n  font:bold 10px/13px Arial;\n}\n.grid-icon{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:4px;top:5px;\n  width:35px;height:25px;\n  border:1px solid #7eb6b6;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 5px,#8fc6bd 5px 6px),\n    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#fff 0 8px,#efc87f 8px 9px);\n}\n.boxes{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:5px;top:6px;\n  width:30px;height:25px;\n  background:#58b898;\n  border:2px solid #317d78;\n}\n.boxes:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-6px;top:5px;\n  width:17px;height:20px;\n  background:#ffbd3d;\n  border:2px solid #bc7c30;\n}\n.rice-bowl{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:7px;top:11px;\n  width:30px;height:14px;\n  border:2px solid #43899d;\n  border-radius:2px 2px 15px 15px;\n  background:#fff2bd;\n}\n.rice-bowl:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-2px;top:-6px;\n  width:30px;height:7px;\n  border:2px solid #43899d;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n\n.notice-grid{\n  height:100%;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);\n  grid-template-rows:repeat(2,1fr);\n}\n.notice{\n  position:relative;\n  padding:5px 5px 55px;\n  border-right:3px solid #fff;\n  border-bottom:3px solid #fff;\n  background:#eeeafd;\n}\n.notice:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}\n.notice:nth-child(n+4){border-bottom:0}\n.notice:nth-child(2),.notice:nth-child(5){background:#e1def8}\n.notice:nth-child(3),.notice:nth-child(6){background:#e9e6fb}\n.notice p{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:7.5px;\n  line-height:11px;\n  font-weight:600;\n}\n.notice-art{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:5px;\n  right:5px;\n  bottom:3px;\n  height:50px;\n}\n.no,.yes{\n  position:absolute;\n  right:2px;\n  font:bold 14px Arial,sans-serif;\n}\n.no{top:11px;color:#e31d1d}\n.yes{bottom:2px;color:#32a433}\n.symbol{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:18px;\n  width:11px;\n  height:27px;\n  border:2px solid #555;\n  border-radius:3px;\n  background:#e32b27;\n  transform:rotate(-18deg);\n}\n.symbol.top{top:0}\n.symbol.bottom{bottom:0;background:#f6f1df}\n.spoon-drawing{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:18px;\n  top:3px;\n  width:14px;\n  height:40px;\n  border:1px solid #53818c;\n  border-radius:10px 10px 5px 5px;\n  background:#f0e5cd;\n  transform:rotate(25deg);\n}\n.spoon-drawing:after{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:4px;bottom:-18px;\n  width:4px;height:22px;\n  background:#d7d4c7;\n}\n.bottle{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:13px;\n  top:4px;\n  width:22px;\n  height:38px;\n  border:2px solid #4a969a;\n  border-radius:4px;\n  background:#e5f5dc;\n}\n.bottle:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:5px;top:-8px;\n  width:8px;height:9px;\n  border:2px solid #4a969a;\n  border-bottom:0;\n  background:#fff1c6;\n}\n.mini-bowl{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:12px;\n  bottom:4px;\n  width:35px;\n  height:15px;\n  border:2px solid #43899d;\n  border-radius:2px 2px 17px 17px;\n  background:#fff2a8;\n}\n.mini-bowl:before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-2px;top:-7px;\n  width:35px;height:8px;\n  border:2px solid #43899d;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n.steam{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:25px;\n  top:2px;\n  color:#dc362a;\n  font-size:18px;\n  letter-spacing:2px;\n}\n.drop-row{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:8px;bottom:7px;\n  display:flex;\n  gap:7px;\n  transform:rotate(-30deg);\n}\n.drop{\n  width:8px;height:14px;\n  border-radius:50% 50% 55% 55%;\n  background:#ef5b57;\n}\n.drop:nth-child(2){background:#f1c748}\n.drop:nth-child(3){background:#f09bb6}\n.drop:nth-child(4){background:#eb6750}\n.small-no{position:absolute;right:0;top:7px;color:#df2020;font:bold 13px Arial}\n.small-yes{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:3px;color:#319c38;font:bold 13px Arial}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <span class=\"deco d1\"></span>\n      <span class=\"deco d2\"></span>\n      <span class=\"deco d3\"></span>\n      <span class=\"deco d4\"></span>\n      <span class=\"deco d5\"></span>\n      <span class=\"deco d6\"></span>\n      <h1 class=\"main-title\">宝宝米粉添加指南</h1>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"layout\">\n      <section class=\"section s1\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <span class=\"heading-number\">1</span>\n          <h2>不同阶段宝宝米粉选择</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"intro\">每个阶段宝宝对辅食的营养需求会存在差异，根据宝宝生长发育选择分阶段米粉，为宝宝提供更精准更科学的营养。</div>\n\n          <article class=\"stage\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第一阶段：宝宝能坐了</div>\n            <p>宝宝可以辅助靠坐等先决——这时添加1段米粉。<br>1段米粉含铁高，粉质细腻好吸收~<br>适应后可添加蔬菜泥和水果泥。</p>\n            <div class=\"stage-icon placeholder\"><b>6+</b>[illegible]<span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: sitting baby]</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"stage\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第二阶段：宝宝爱吃了</div>\n            <p>宝宝萌牙期——这时可添加2段米粉。<br>2段米粉在1段基础上会添加一些蔬果颗粒，用以启蒙咀嚼<br>另外维生素D可促进钙吸收~</p>\n            <div class=\"stage-icon placeholder\"><b>8+</b>[illegible]<span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: chewing baby]</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"stage\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第三阶段：宝宝能咀嚼</div>\n            <p>宝宝会爬行——这时可添加3段米粉。<br>3段米粉相比2段米粉添加了多种更大的果蔬颗粒，以此强化锻炼宝宝咀嚼力，并且多维会[?]，口感丰富，<br>更能激发宝宝的味蕾，让宝宝爱上吃</p>\n            <div class=\"stage-icon placeholder\"><b>9+</b>[illegible]<span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: crawling baby]</span></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section s2\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <span class=\"heading-number\">2</span>\n          <h2>宝宝吃米粉的好处</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-list\">\n            <article class=\"benefit\">\n              <h3>1、补充乳类中不足的营养</h3>\n              <p>添加米粉等辅食，可及时补充母乳中铁和维生素的不足。</p>\n              <div class=\"benefit-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"bowl\"></div><div class=\"spoon\"></div>\n                <span class=\"nutrient fe\">Fe</span><span class=\"nutrient vd\">Vd</span>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: bowl with nutrients]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"benefit\">\n              <h3>2、训练宝宝的吞咽能力</h3>\n              <p>宝宝可以从泥糊状、细软的食品开始，逐步适应、接受成年人吃的固体食物。</p>\n              <div class=\"benefit-art placeholder\"><div class=\"bowl\"></div><div class=\"spoon\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: feeding bowls]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"benefit\">\n              <h3>3、为断奶做准备</h3>\n              <p>辅食逐渐取代乳类，让宝宝逐渐由吸食乳类变为用成年人的方式咀嚼食物。</p>\n              <div class=\"benefit-art placeholder\"><div class=\"bowl\"></div><div class=\"baby-face\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: baby and bowl]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"benefit\">\n              <h3>4、开启宝宝智力</h3>\n              <p>添加辅食可以给予宝宝多种刺激，进而达到促进智力的目的。</p>\n              <div class=\"benefit-art placeholder\"><div class=\"bowl\"></div><div class=\"brain\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: brain and bowl]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"benefit\">\n              <h3>5、训练咀嚼能力</h3>\n              <p>及时添加辅食有利于训练宝宝的咀嚼功能，有利于颌骨的发育和牙齿的萌出。</p>\n              <div class=\"benefit-art placeholder\"><div class=\"baby-face\"></div><div class=\"tooth\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: baby and tooth]</span></div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section s3\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <span class=\"heading-number\">3</span>\n          <h2>如何挑选宝宝米粉</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"pick-list\">\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>1、选择品牌产品</h3>\n              <p>建议选择大品牌、口碑好的产品，其质量相对而言更有保障。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"package\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: packaged product]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>2、查看产品标识</h3>\n              <p>看一看正常商品应该有的标识是否齐全，宝宝产品标签的标注以及说明是否符合要求。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"package\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: product label]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>3、查验营养成分表</h3>\n              <p>查看所含的具体营养成分及其含量是否在合理范围内。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"grid-icon\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: nutrition table]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>4、查看包装说明</h3>\n              <p>查看外包装上是否有适用标示说明，比如断奶期补充食物等。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"boxes\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: package instructions]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>5、看颜色与气味</h3>\n              <p>正常是米白色、大小均匀，雪白纯正，散发米粉特有的香味，且无其他异味。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"rice-bowl\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: bowl of rice cereal]</span></div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"pick\">\n              <h3>6、看组织形态和冲调性</h3>\n              <p>其性状松散无结块，冲调后为泥糊状。</p>\n              <div class=\"pick-art placeholder\"><div class=\"rice-bowl\"></div><div class=\"spoon\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: mixed rice cereal]</span></div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section s4\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <span class=\"heading-number\">4</span>\n          <h2>宝宝吃米粉的注意事项</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"notice-grid\">\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>1、冲调米粉水温不宜过高，用烧开的水晾到40~50度左右冲调米粉为宜</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"symbol top\"></div><span class=\"no\">No</span>\n                <div class=\"symbol bottom\"></div><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: unsuitable and suitable water temperature]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>2、喂米粉时需要用勺子喂，不建议使用奶瓶</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"bottle\"></div><span class=\"no\">No</span>\n                <div class=\"spoon-drawing\" style=\"top:19px;left:28px;transform:rotate(62deg)\"></div><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: bottle no, spoon yes]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>3、选择营养素含量多的配方米粉，不添加蔗糖和食盐</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <span class=\"small-no\">No</span><span class=\"small-yes\">Yes</span>\n                <div class=\"package\" style=\"left:11px;top:12px\"></div>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: cereal ingredients]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>4、不宜把米粉添加在奶液里，以免无法满足婴儿生长发育的需要</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"mini-bowl\" style=\"bottom:23px\"></div><div class=\"steam\">〰</div><span class=\"no\">No</span>\n                <div class=\"mini-bowl\"></div><span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: do not mix cereal into milk]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>5、冲调米粉应先稀后稠逐渐增加稠度</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"mini-bowl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"spoon-drawing\" style=\"left:34px;top:-3px;transform:rotate(68deg)\"></div>\n                <span class=\"yes\">Yes</span>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: gradually thicken cereal]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"notice\">\n              <p>6、首次喂1-2勺，宝宝适应后慢慢增加到3-4勺，每天喂1-2次</p>\n              <div class=\"notice-art placeholder\">\n                <div class=\"drop-row\"><span class=\"drop\"></span><span class=\"drop\"></span><span class=\"drop\"></span><span class=\"drop\"></span></div>\n                <span class=\"yes\">Yes</span>\n                <span class=\"caption\">[Illustration: increasing spoonfuls]</span>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
